claim.claim-text:
a display module (100) including a display panel (110) configured to display an image;
a vibration plate (200) on a rear surface of the display module (100);
at least one vibration generating device (410, 430) provided on the vibration plate (200), the vibration generating device (410, 430) comprising a pair of first sides (S1a, S1b) parallel to a first direction (X), each first side (S1a, S1b) having a first length (L1), and a pair of second sides (S2a, S2b) parallel to a second direction (Y) intersecting the first direction (X), each having a second length (L2); and
an enclosure (500) between the display module (100) and the vibration plate (200), the enclosure (500) being spaced apart from the vibration generating device (410, 430) and surrounding the vibration generating device (410, 430), the enclosure (500) having a third length (L3) that is longer than the first length (L1) of the vibration generating device (410, 430) and a fourth length (L4) that is longer than the second length (L2) of the vibration generating device (410, 430).

a system body (10);
the display apparatus (30) of one of any one of the preceding claims; and
a hinge part (20) between the system body (10) and the display apparatus (30), the hinge part (20) being configured to rotatably support the display apparatus (30).
